cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use faultflow in academic or professional work, please cite it as below."
title: faultflow
abstract: >-
  An open-source ATPG and fault simulation engine for Yosys gate-level
  netlists. SAT-based test generation with CaDiCaL, stuck-at and transition
  fault models, scan insertion and scan ATPG, IEEE 1500 core wrapping and
  hierarchical SoC coverage aggregation.
type: software
authors:
